<title>JAPAN: S.Korea's Daewoo gets securities licence in Tokyo.</title>
<headline>S.Korea's Daewoo gets securities licence in Tokyo.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's Daewoo Securities Co Ltd has been granted a securities licence by Japan's Finance Ministry, the ministry said on Friday.</p>
<p>Daewoo is the fifth South Korean securities house to have received a securities licence in Japan, which will allow it to deal, broker, underwrite and sell securities.</p>
<p>Daewoo's Tokyo branch has a staff of 13.</p>
<p>Including Daewoo, there are 55 foreign securities houses in Japan and 72 branches.</p>
</text>
